        "pnpm typecheck, pnpm lint and pnpm test exit 0 on the upgraded toolchain, with no fewer passing test files (99) and passing tests (1396) than before the change and no test file edited to get there.",
        "CHANGELOG.md gains an Unreleased entry naming the vitest major move and the fast-uri resolution."
